_irljr\"><div class=\"__20-NoticeDetail_subtitle__Eu01S\"><span class=\"__20-NoticeDetail_type__fRshy\">Notices</span><span class=\"__20-NoticeDetail_date__A4MY4\">2026-09-30 07:00</span></div><div class=\"__20-NoticeDetail_title__cALu9\">[OrbiPom! MERGE!] Fun &amp; Games Event Details</div><div class=\"__20-NoticeDetail_divider__Kqd1D\"></div><div class=\"__20-NoticeDetail_content__wIAEN\"><img src=\"https://web-static.hg-cdn.com/upload/image/20260923/c97f4f208900fe7a9e5d11f26f002a71.jpg\" data-width=\"1650\" data-height=\"300\"><p><span><strong>▼// Event Time </strong></span></p><p><span>Oct. 1, 2026 at 12:00 (server time) – Before version update and maintenance </span></p><p><br></p><p><span><strong>▼// Event Rewards </strong></span></p><p><span>Complete missions during the event to earn event rewards including [Oroberyls] and [T-Creds]. </span></p><p><br></p><p><span><strong>▼// Participation Requirements </strong></span></p><p><span>Complete the main mission [Chapter I Process II: Paving the Way] </span></p><p><br></p><p><span><strong>▼// Event Details </strong></span></p><p><span>· Go to the web event, merge OrbiPoms of the same type to get bigger OrbiPoms and earn points, then claim generous rewards. </span></p><p><br></p><p><span>※ Asia Server Time Zone: UTC+8 </span></p><p><span>※ Americas / Europe Server Time Zone: UTC-5 </span></p><p><span>※ For more event details, check the in-game [Event Center].</span></p></div></div></div>",
